#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:330
#, no-c-format
msgid "Features"
msgstr "Características"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:331
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can set several graphs on the same view. Just use the <guilabel>Add</"
"guilabel> button when you are in List mode. You can set each graph its own "
"color."
msgstr ""
"Pódense colocar varias gráficas na mesma vista. Só hai que empregar o botón "
"<guilabel>Engadir</guilabel> no modo Lista. Pódeselle asignar a súa propia "
"cor a cada gráfica."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:334
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The view can be zoomed and moved with the mouse. Using the wheel you can "
"zoom in and out. You can also select an area with the left button of the "
"mouse and this area will be zoomed in. Move the view with the arrow keys."
msgstr ""
"A vista pódese ampliar e mover co rato. Coa rodiña pódese achegar e alonxar. "
